  "accepted_answers": [
    "John II Orsini",
    "John Komnenos Asen"
  ],
  "explanation": "The original sources consistently state that Anna Palaiologina was married to John II Orsini and later to John Komnenos Asen. These two marriages are directly supported by multiple documents (D1S1, D1S2, D3S2, D4S11). Other proposed candidates such as Manuel II Palaiologos, Thomas Preljubović, John VIII Palaiologos, and Andronikos III Palaiologos either refer to different individuals or are not directly stated as spouses of Anna Palaiologina in the provided context."
}
